o;s 8 grids in Maverick County has a record from 1951 to 2025, and March to April came in under 90% of normal in 43 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 23% of normal in August to September and 17% in November to December. So far in 2026 it ran 217% of normal in June to July. Grid 10918 had its driest year in 1956 at 30% of normal.</p>"}
